comes as a result of your god fixing a major problem. Now you have to
artificially create that problem before you pray. Here's the scoop:

1) Be absolutely sure you can pray. A timeout of 600-700 is a good range.

2) Be sure that your Max HP is less than 16 for XL1 and 21 for XL2. It's
possible to do at XL3 and less than 26 for XL3, but it's unlikely it'll
happen.

3) Allow some low level monster (it's the protection racket so they are all
low level) to whack on you until your current HP are 5 or less. Yes this
is a risk, as you can die from being whacked too much. Usually I'll corner
a newt or something like it in a corridor and let it have at it.

4) Now you pray with a major problem. Your god will heal all your hitpoints
and bump your MAXHP by up to 5.

If you are still below the limits for the level (1 MAXHP added happens quite
a bit) rinse and repeat about 600 turns later.

